<BaseLayout
  title="About — Jasper Gabriel"
  description="A bit about me — who I am, what I do, and what I care about."
>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <div class="about-content">
      <p>
        Hello world, I'm Jasper Gabriel, a software engineer specializing in
        backend systems and cloud infrastructure. I've spent the last 4 years
        building fintech and crypto products, and I do my best work at
        early-stage startups, where I get to wear multiple hats and work across
        the whole stack.
      </p>
      <p>
        Lately I'm exploring cryptography, zero-knowledge proofs, and
        cybersecurity.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is where I write down what I learn about coding, career, side
        projects, and anything else that piques my interest.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I'm not building software, I'm probably reading, playing video
        games, watching YouTube videos, or playing the piano.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can find me on <a
          href="https://github.com/jdg2896"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a
        >
        or <a
          href="https://linkedin.com/in/jaspergabriel"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a
        >, or reach me directly at <a href="mailto:jasper.d.gabriel@gmail.com"
          >jasper.d.gabriel@gmail.com</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
